stage_prompts.infeasible:
[InfeasibleStage]
A permanent blocker with no remaining path is infeasible. An untried tool, uninspected input, retryable error, or remaining path is still feasible.
Return JSON only: {"is_infeasible":true|false,"reason":"..."}

stage_prompts.subintent_complete:
[SubIntentCompleteStage]
Judge whether completed child results satisfy every parent Intent requirement and side effect.
Return JSON only: {"can_complete":true|false,"reason":"...","context_summary":"..."}

stage_prompts.complete:
[CompleteStage]
Judge whether the ordinary tool results satisfy every current Intent requirement. Preserve concrete values.
Return JSON only: {"is_complete":true|false,"reason":"...","summary":"..."}
